# This file used to be a ~1300 line aggregator: components_unittests,
# components_browsertests, components_perftests and the resource paks that fed
# them, each enumerating every component in the tree.
#
# 371 of the 412 component directories have been deleted, so nearly every entry
# in those lists pointed at nothing. The only remaining referrers to
# //components:* were themselves test targets in //pdf, //tools/cygprofile and
# //tools/pgo, all of which are gone too.
#
# Individual components still have their own BUILD.gn files; this directory
# simply no longer defines anything.
